      en: ["Martin Brod is located at the confluence of the Unac and Una Rivers.", "The largest waterfall, Milančev buk, reaches a height of 54 meters.", "The village has been part of the Una National Park since its founding in 2008.", "The Orthodox Rmanj Monastery was first mentioned in historical records in 1443.", "The system of waterfalls extends over a total length of 800 meters.", "A significant site of travertine formations is located in the vicinity."],
